    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d212">

                <pb facs="0256" n="140" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg140"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/995.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-06-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 18, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The bankers today, on the responsibility of the ministers, agreed to advance
                    another 3,000,000 taels because of the urgent necessity. The situation is one of
                    great stress and suspense.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Calhoun.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
